{"id":"04a55d66a0f91cb3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S007Conseq.md","title":"S007Conseq","display":"S007Conseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"S007Conseq","parameters":["F","R","f","r","g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"S007Conseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：编号入口固定参数。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>固定入口参数；其余参数沿被调用定义的顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ S007Conseq F R f r g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E (and (@ Num0 E) (@ FConseq E F R f r g a)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ab9e67d837fd090\" href=\"?note=4ab9e67d837fd090\" title=\"ZFC_FConseq\">FConseq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref